NOTICE

vega uses CivSYS (https://github.com/ashvyagni/CivSYS), a project by its owner
ashvyagni, as a dependency. CivSYS is included only as a git submodule
(civsys/) that points at upstream commit
70420010a01407b7f7bf400cc426f0597f6ad291
("Add complete project files and assets"). No CivSYS source is copied
into this repository, and CivSYS is not modified. vega's author is a
contributor to CivSYS.

The CivSYS repository has no LICENSE file, so default copyright applies to
CivSYS code. Cloning the submodule fetches it from the upstream repository.

Everything outside civsys/ is vega's own code: civsys_focal/, mind/, growth/,
battery/, whiteroom/, experiments/, scripts/, prereg/, tests/, and the
documents and results. It is experimental research code.
